  <item>
    <title>EP57 豆瓣二十周年：我们的精神角落还是精神病角落？（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fb5628623bc78c3949dcb5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fb5628623bc78c3949dcb5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 06:40:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">7:27</a> 谁在用豆瓣？——丧逼？文化人？文青？文艺逼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">7:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> “无价值用户”吐槽豆瓣：变现能力差导致用户流失，审核严格自由受限，功能难用做啥啥失败——风水不好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 豆瓣的意义：像星星的友邻，没有太多道德评判，爱唱反调的豆瓣er，真诚而非出于商业利益的旅行推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a> 书影音评价代表了谁的意见？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 豆瓣倒闭了怎么办？会有豆瓣的替代品吗？展望未来？</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：落北</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/621f89c2b3227be4086fbb8d/lvoLYMxTjFi2Wci7jkVUyFHTZwvJ.m4a" length="38112826" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zya0xaM01DdGFzRkVKTVlLS2NTSEZqTFM3T3kuanBn.jpg"/>
