  <item>
    <title>EP56 豆瓣二十周年：我们的精神角落还是精神病角落？（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e2a5eaaf5840b3333b1ac8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e2a5eaaf5840b3333b1ac8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 12:56:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">6:11</a> 老豆瓣er们的豆瓣之旅伊始：为偶像，为crush，为捡垃圾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">6:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 难忘的友邻：德国的哲学博士，非主流的小凤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a> 百花齐放的豆瓣小组：北京租房小组、鹅组、象组、炸厨房组、下厨房组、隐居组、父母皆祸害组、马景涛咆哮组、好学生心态受害者组、凡尔赛学研习小组、史上最沉默组……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 豆瓣广播：垃圾话的自留地、男通讯录的“豆瓣春晚”、“苦难现实派”、有灵气的文字友邻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2241">37:21</a> 豆瓣是分享真实生活、驱逐虚假（母神与晚晚）的生人平台，是耍宝与严谨并存的书影音档案</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：落北</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/621f89c2b3227be4086fbb8d/llO2cKymNLYrPwTBmlRB-hSLZJV3.m4a" length="36248350" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zya0xaM01DdGFzRkVKTVlLS2NTSEZqTFM3T3kuanBn.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
