  <item>
    <title>EP55 新上任的女领导该怎么应对下属的下马威？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d6dd160766616acd59c477</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d6dd160766616acd59c477</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Mar 2025 14:24:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 新官上任第一把火就烧糊啦！团队讨论乱成一团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 慌张以外，我认真听了争论，然后就……玩消失了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 艰难的抉择：是否继续与不配合的员工工作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 经历过无数个不眠之夜，我艰难地迈出了第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 是个人成长还是机构对自己的异化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 与冲突共处，开会就是要讨论不同意见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> Nobody cares! 你可以不做“好学生”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">43:32</a> 年轻小领导，什么对你和团队来说什么最重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/621f89c2b3227be4086fbb8d/ljRBQEdDCH3iVttr1cEBl4qMgfuH.m4a" length="60746947" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:31</itunes:duration>
