  <item>
    <title>EP52 p人带着j人的老挝之旅，我活着回来啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c3761e3af97665afb5c75b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c3761e3af97665afb5c75b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Feb 2024 12:22:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 为什么选择老挝？——东南亚的“唯一”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">07:53</a> 老挝的亲切感——中国援建的公路铁路、遍地中文、“傣装傣语”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">07:53</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 老挝怎么玩？有机会一定要体验中老铁路去琅勃拉邦、万荣、万象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 跟着p人走，旅途中充满了悬疑和惊喜——差点没买到的火车票，找不到的酒店，无法预知的行程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 对出片的极致要求——p人唯一的攻略是拍照点位，唯一的确定行程是全妆和配搭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 通透的人生领悟——只有你p过的照片会永垂不朽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 在威逼利诱和引导下，我在一声声赞美中沦陷，每天跟着精致出片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 户外和躺平、高性价比的消费和多币种支付的包容性——总有一个点能打动你！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> 佛教的布施文化——赠予与反哺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 游客眼中的僧侣 vs 僧侣眼中的游客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">47:15</a> 让人飘飘欲仙的东南亚烧烤火锅——Mookata</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkg6jGg2TN7JARQ3NOWZNTvYFovj.m4a" length="69051868" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:15</itunes:duration>
