  <item>
    <title>EP51 京都：神佛共处，百鬼夜行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b8eeae1ed6d5797f5b2d1d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b8eeae1ed6d5797f5b2d1d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jan 2024 12:42:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a> 度假？旅行？日本是部难以轻易翻开的书，是“最熟悉的陌生人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 为了进入京都这座有“门槛”的城市我做的功课：读书、观影、小红书、Google Map</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 区别于其他日本人的京都人：茶泡饭、倒置扫帚、“下雪”的甜点、骨正月、瞪眼鲷、多扫一尺地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1821">30:21</a> 日本文化观察：内化外来文化而高度自洽，风格自成一体</span></p><span></span><p><span>京都的神社与佛寺之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1821">30:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 下鸭神社的相生社与纠森林，清水寺的年度汉字与红豆年糕汤，“不务正业”的佛光寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 尘嚣之外大觉寺抄心经，浮光跃金大沢池，舞姬隐居的“小苔寺”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a> 1200尊石罗汉的爱宕念佛寺，守护女性的市比卖神社，能实现一个愿望的天之真名井，丑时之女与铁轮井</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3843">64:03</a> 怀石料理与番菜，脆弱而美丽的日本</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnkpzjoGiEs6AY8X0xrsSRpdnuTp.m4a" length="94132294" type="audio/mp4"/>
