  <item>
    <title>EP50 被“前女友”骗去传销——我醒了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a8a1d5926ad7aad019f40c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a8a1d5926ad7aad019f40c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jan 2024 03:58:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“借我借我一双慧眼吧，让我把这纷扰看得清清楚楚明明白白真真切切。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">5:31</a> 带上我的“铁T女友”回老家应付催婚，假情侣也有真情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">5:31</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> 拉拉混gay圈蹲下线；双向考察、谎言邀约、心理车轮战，防线逐步瓦解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a> 利用你的心理账户，模糊的分红制度，似是而非的“保底”，下线养上线的“金字塔”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> “大家庭”给了我有鸡肉的“心灵鸡汤”，我升到了四星，上线却赔了三十万走了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2169">36:09</a> 传销究竟合不合法？传销培训讲了什么知识点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2169">36:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">44:49</a> 庞氏骗局，传销式保险，亲历某国际美妆直销大牌的神秘仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">44:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3408">56:48</a> 反思：破除迷障，看清本质，远离传销</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：金莲</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
