  <item>
    <title>EP49 三十岁，我的人生迎来转折了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659d4fa86d045a7f5ebd85fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659d4fa86d045a7f5ebd85fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jan 2024 13:52:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">4:22</a> 对三十岁的想象——都市丽人或忙于家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">4:22</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 我的人生进度并非十进制，三十岁前我完成了转行、MBA、辞职</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 2023年才是我真正的转折点——职业生涯的身份转化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 过去的半年我经历了“极其痛苦”的成长——当一个讨好型人格的我需要做很多艰难的决定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 发疯很重要——让别人不舒服的人应当被社会毒打，而我可以当那个“社会”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 我开始学会拒绝别人——作为译员，被要求做会务工作怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 做业务和做管理，你搞清楚自己适合什么职业路径了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a> 社交 vs 交朋友 —— e人和i人的看法和标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 爸爸妈妈变成了我们的“孩子”——我开始给爸妈建议，成为他们“嘚瑟”的资本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> 30岁是老了吗？ 不要再相信这样的心理暗示啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrSzmnYUWAwWIqDDEB3ywJyfkM70.m4a" length="71855104" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zya0xaM01DdGFzRkVKTVlLS2NTSEZqTFM3T3kuanBn.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP48 第一次和妈出国，回来我们关系还好吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65280430ba2ed85c6d1c954f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65280430ba2ed85c6d1c954f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Oct 2023 14:35:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">7:23</a> 第一次带妈去欧洲的总统级别准备工作中，最有用的是哪个？</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">7:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">9:47</a> 妈妈看不懂地铁指示牌就像当年我们看不懂时钟一样</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">9:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> “hello”和“thank you”挂在嘴边带来的舒适感</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 为什么我们有一种“外国人都很nice”的感觉 —— 生活和工作中的松弛感是从哪里来的</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a> 观看皇宫换岗仪式的时候，站在前面的小朋友给我妈妈让了位置 —— equity和equality的区别</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 在马来西亚、欧洲和中国——一些对孩子们礼仪的观察</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a> 孩子们本都一样，是教育和文化塑造了他们</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 妈妈出门第三天就没忍住吃了火锅，外国人煮海鲜和肉竟然不杀腥！</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">45:54</a> 关于退税没退成，我们有争论但没有争吵</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">45:54</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> 母女的角色转换，到了考验我耐心和体力的时候——一起出去玩到底累不累</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3365">56:05</a> 相信妈妈，就像当年她相信我们一样——就算散装英语和肢体语言都行不通，我们还可以腿天下</span><br><span></span><br><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span><br><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqLfJHKPN63jFIw-wYX-7QEdDC1A.m4a" length="82406413" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zya0xaM01DdGFzRkVKTVlLS2NTSEZqTFM3T3kuanBn.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP47 东马游记：在仙本那和亚庇能找到旅行的意义吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/651e9970a3b0404cbfa716ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">651e9970a3b0404cbfa716ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Oct 2023 11:09:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“换种方式生活会好些。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 厘清几个概念：婆罗洲、沙巴州、仙本那、亚庇（哥打京那巴鲁）、斗湖、“风下之乡”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 一夜未睡，航班延误，25分钟完成了过海关入境、过安检登机，我是超人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a> 仙本那一场雨，仙境沦为泥泞人间，却让我梦回童年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3067">51:07</a> 狂风暴雨中上岛，本能地感知潮汐，徜徉于海底天堂，简朴的岛上生活让我顿悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3067">51:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a> 探秘巴瑶族：无国籍海洋游牧民族，首批具有适应潜水基因的人类，美丽而凄凉的墓地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4108">68:28</a> 文化观察：对陌生人微笑，无处不在的中国痕迹，母女相处模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4108">68:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4352">72:32</a> 旅行的意义到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsacjXjvva7gCSsHCqW14GDkm5vU.m4a" length="106188481" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZsWW9JOHRmeXZhREtQXzF1T0puc2dUMk5QQnkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP46 国美建筑生为何转行人道主义？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e1cc963fa4090b74bf60e4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e1cc963fa4090b74bf60e4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Aug 2023 08:19:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">7:14</a> 中国美术学院建筑系是我的折中选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">7:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a> 建筑是一种改变世界的工具吗——皖南的高墙和西南的火塘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 我想象的建筑系和学校里的建筑系——东南大学和美院的流派有什么差别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 从大一到大五，一个建筑师的养成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> 根植于中国本土的建筑并不是一味的仿古</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a> 在建筑行业的两年改变了我对这个行业的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a> 离开这个行业我有遗憾，但建筑无法解答我对世界的疑惑了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a> 研究生去“内样儿”的巴政读了“城管”专业，命运的齿轮开始转动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3657">60:57</a> 希望让移民难民生活得好一些，并没有那么容易</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：XC</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqpmZfNEpUaFN80NaYQahLxcfvJ-.m4a" length="88405420" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zya0xaM01DdGFzRkVKTVlLS2NTSEZqTFM3T3kuanBn.jpg"/>
