  <item>
    <title>EP44 【回顾】我们该如何走出抑郁的泥沼？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a6c9260c9873af3082ed22</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a6c9260c9873af3082ed22</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Jul 2023 14:01:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>惊闻Coco的离去，愕然与惋惜之下，想起了曾经邀请嘉宾公子录制的这一期播客，今天再次分享，希望能给陷于抑郁泥沼的朋友们带来温暖与力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">5:36</a> 抑郁像感冒一样普遍，但感冒了大家都知道要吃药，抑郁了却被劝说“想开点”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">5:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a> 每天做着自己不喜欢（但看上去正确）的事，必然会不快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 一组数字来认识抑郁症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> 情伤造成的伤口，我拖了四五年没有“缝合”，最终决定开始疗伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> 家人办“鸿门宴”、傻逼领导当着所有人面挑我刺，孤立无援的我身心俱疲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 不专业的医生治不好我的失眠与暴饮暴食，我竟从舞蹈老师那里得到了疗愈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 我帮助整日以泪洗面的舍友解开心结，自己也从专业的心理咨询中获得解脱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">45:34</a> 接纳自我情绪是爱自己的开始，理解他人情绪是健康关系的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">45:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2848">47:28</a> 不要低估自己应对困难的能力，放下让你不快的事物，接触美好的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：公子</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：喜乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：60km/h —— 晨曦光廊</span></p>]]></description>
