  <item>
    <title>EP43 前任和我的直系朋友单约，我该生气吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649d9e6dfb908e66d5b8ac0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649d9e6dfb908e66d5b8ac0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jun 2023 15:08:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> 前任持续约我的直系朋友见面还double date是为什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 我到底为什么生气？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> 什么是边界？情绪会告诉你你的边界被侵犯了</span></p><span></span><p><span>15::21-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> 亲密关系中的“特洛伊木马”——换“情头”、交换手机密码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a> 让我放弃现在的生活结束异地，约会对象在我的边界上放“原子弹”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a> 异性恋边界的极限拉扯——让一个不愿意生孩子的女性生孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 边界具有天然的正义性，要有勇气为了守住了自己的边界而说不</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Jun &amp; Han</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：何师傅</span></p>]]></description>
